    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uko Abisirayeli bazakizwa ibihano by'ibyaha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwa bakurikirana gukiranuka mwe, mugashaka Uwiteka nimunyumve, murebe igitare mwasatuweho n'urwobo rw'inganzo mwacukuwemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimurebe Aburahamu sogokuruza na Sara wababyaye, kuko ubwo Aburahamu yari akiri umwe namuhamagaye, nkamuha umugisha nkamugwiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uwiteka ahumurije i Siyoni n'imyanya yaho yose yabaye imyirare arayihumurije, ubutayu bwaho abuhinduye nka Edeni n'ikidaturwa cyaho akigize nka ya ngobyi y'Uwiteka, muri yo hazaba umunezero n'ibyishimo n'impundu n'amajwi y'indirimbo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwoko bwanjye nimunyumve, shyanga ryanjye muntegere amatwi kuko ari jye itegeko rizaturukaho, kandi nzashyiraho amategeko yanjye abe umucyo uvira amahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gukiranuka kwanjye kuri hafi, agakiza kanjye karasohotse. Amaboko yanjye azacira amahanga imanza, ibirwa bizantegereza kandi ukuboko kwanjye ni ko baziringira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwubure amaso yanyu murebe ijuru, murebe no ku isi hasi. Ijuru rizatamuruka nk'umwotsi n'isi izasaza nk'umwambaro, n'abayibamo bazapfa nk'isazi, ariko agakiza kanjye kazagumaho iteka ryose kandi gukiranuka kwanjye ntikuzakuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nimunyumve yemwe abazi gukiranuka, ishyanga rifite amategeko yanjye mu mitima yabo, ntimugatinye gutukwa n'abantu kandi ntimugahagarikwe imitima n'ibitutsi byabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko inyenzi zizabarya nk'uko zirya imyambaro, n'umuranda uzabarya nk'uko urya ubwoya bw'intama, ariko gukiranuka kwanjye kuzahoraho iteka n'agakiza kanjye kazagumaho ibihe byose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanguka, kanguka, wambarane imbaraga, wa kuboko k'Uwiteka we. Kanguka nko mu minsi ya kera, nko ku ngoma z'ibihe byashize. Si wowe se watemaguye Rahahu ugasogota cya Kiyoka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si wowe wakamije inyanja y'amazi maremare y'imuhengeri, ukarema inzira imuhengeri ku butaka bwo mu nyanja ngo abacunguwe bayinyuremo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko abo Uwiteka yacunguye bazagaruka bajye i Siyoni baririmba. Umunezero uhoraho uzaba ku mitwe yabo, bazagira umunezero n'ibyishimo, umubabaro no gusuhuza umutima bizahunga umuhashya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jye ubwanjye ni jye ubahumuriza. Uri muntu ki, yewe utinya umuntu kandi azapfa, ugatinya n'umwana w'umuntu uzahindurwa nk'ubwatsi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukibagirwa Uwiteka wakuremye, ari we wabambye ijuru agashyiraho n'imfatiro z'isi, maze ukīriza umunsi watinye uburakari bw'umugome, iyo yitegura kurimbura? Mbese uburakari bw'umugome butwaye iki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyagano b'ibicibwa bazabohorwa vuba, ntibazapfa ngo bajye muri rwa rwobo, kandi ibyokurya byabo ntibizabura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuko ndi Uwiteka Imana yawe, ntera imiraba kuzīkuka mu nyanja, igahorera. Uwiteka Nyiringabo ni ryo zina rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nshyize amagambo yanjye mu kanwa kawe, ngutwikirije igicucu cy'ukuboko kwanjye, kugira ngo ntere ijuru rishya, nshinge imfatiro z'isi nshya, mbwire i Siyoni nti ‘Muri ubwoko bwanjye.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
