        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.14.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 14.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.16.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kanguka, kanguka, byuka uhagarare Yerusalemu Uwiteka yashomeje ku gikombe cy'umujinya we, unyoye igikombe cy'ibidandabiranya, uracyiranguza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bahungu yabyaye bose nta wo kumuyobora ubarimo, kandi mu bo yareze bose nta wo kumufata ukuboko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibi byombi bikugezeho! Ni nde uzakuririra? Kuba amatongo no kurimbuka, n'inzara n'inkota ko biguteye, naguhumuriza nte? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abahungu bawe bararabye bagwa mu mayirabiri hose, nk'uko isasu igwa mu kigoyi, bijuse umujinya w'Uwiteka ari wo guhana kw'Imana yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero noneho umva ibi, yewe urengana ugasinda utanyoye vino, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 51:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "umva ibyo Uwiteka Umwami wawe kandi Imana yawe iburana urubanza rw'abantu bayo iti “Dore nkwatse igikombe cy'ibidandabiranya, ari cyo gikombe cy'umujinya wanjye wari ufite mu ntoki, ntuzongera kukinywaho ukundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.51.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.51.22"
